{
  "info": {
    "name": "User Management API (Sanctum + OTP)",
    "description": "Base URL includes `/api`. Register returns **no token** until **POST /auth/verify-email**. Use **6-digit OTP** from mail (SendGrid + `MAIL_MAILER=smtp`) or `MAIL_MAILER=array` with `php artisan test`. Throttle: registration, verify-email, resend-otp, forgot-password, reset-password.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "2" }
  ],
  "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }] },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [] } }],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"secret123\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/register",
            "description": "**201** `{ message, user }` — `user.is_verified` is false, **no token**. OTP email sent.\n\nSeeded logins: run `db:seed`; use **verify-email** before first-time self-registered logins."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify email",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/verify-email",
            "description": "**200** `{ message, user, token }`. Welcome mail after verify. Saves **token** to collection variable.\n\n**422** invalid OTP / expired.\n\n**429** brute-force lockout (`AUTH_OTP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend registration OTP",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/resend-otp",
            "description": "Generic success message whether or not email exists (unverified only gets mail)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
            "description": "**403** if `is_verified` is false."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/forgot-password",
            "description": "Always **200** with same message (no email enumeration)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset password",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\",\n  \"new_password\": \"newsecret123\",\n  \"new_password_confirmation\": \"newsecret123\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/reset-password",
            "description": "**204** on success. Revokes Sanctum tokens. Body may use **token** instead of **otp**.\n\n**422** validation / invalid code."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/logout",
            "description": "**204**. Bearer token required."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin — Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get user by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users/{{user_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create user",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"New User\",\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"secret123\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users",
            "description": "Admin-created users have **is_verified: true** (no OTP)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update user",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Updated Name\",\n  \"email\": \"updated@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users/{{user_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete user",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users/{{user_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Make admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users/{{user_id}}/make-admin"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/users/{{user_id}}/remove-admin"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
